      "zh": {
        "title": "國防部偵獲23中共機艦船活動 6架次共機逾越中線",
        "summary": "國防部偵獲中共23機艦船於台海活動，其中6架次共機逾越海峽中線，國軍嚴密應處。",
        "body": [
          "台灣國防部表示，自8月13日上午6時至14日上午6時止，偵獲中共機艦船合計23次在台海周邊活動。其中包括中共軍機9架次、軍艦12艘以及公務船2艘。",
          "在偵獲的9架次中共軍機中，有6架次逾越海峽中線進入台灣中部、西南及東部空域。據國防部示意圖，活動機種包含海峽空域的主戰機、無人機與直升機，西南空域的輔戰機，以及東部空域的直升機。",
          "面對中共機艦船持續在台海周邊活動，國軍運用任務機艦及岸置飛彈系統嚴密監控與應處。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Taiwan Detects 23 Chinese Aircraft and Vessels Around Strait; 6 Cross Median Line",
        "summary": "Taiwan's defense ministry detected 23 Chinese aircraft and vessels around the Taiwan Strait as military forces responded.",
        "body": [
          "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense said that 23 Chinese military aircraft and vessels were detected operating around the Taiwan Strait between 6:00 a.m. on August 13 and 6:00 a.m. on August 14. The total included 9 Chinese military aircraft, 12 navy vessels, and 2 official public ships.",
          "Among the 9 detected aircraft, 6 crossed the median line of the Taiwan Strait and entered Taiwan's central, southwestern, and eastern air defense sectors. The aircraft included main fighters, drones, auxiliary aircraft, and helicopters.",
          "Taiwan's armed forces deployed aircraft, naval vessels, and land-based missile systems to closely monitor and respond to the activities."
        ]
      },
